{"approved":false,"back_sample":{"translation":"The player with the highest score wins, the player with the lowest score loses and the player with the highest score wins.","truncated":false},"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"Shared UI copy.intro","detected_language":"de","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"dots-and-boxes.copy.intro","keys":["dots-and-boxes.copy.intro"],"locale":"de","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"Der Spieler mit den meisten Punkten gewinnt, der Spieler mit den wenigsten Punkten verliert und der Spieler mit den meisten Punkten gewinnt.","record_id":"1bdb3ca3038d4a8ad71aa0d20a33e47ea77fcf6b0ed06b1112087156797d6407","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"40565692987","seconds":0.9630333623750005,"source":"Take turns joining neighboring dots. Complete the fourth side of a box to claim it and play again. The player with the most boxes wins.","source_commit":"e8a7cb94dc75d40f2c0e14bb27c0a1819e230012","source_hash":"979bd83a9885e175600aa7e259141508db3e754ca5d4c04f4ade7b23c1703e41","status":"machine-draft","translation":"Der Spieler mit den meisten Punkten gewinnt, der Spieler mit den wenigsten Punkten verliert und der Spieler mit den meisten Punkten gewinnt.","truncated":false,"warnings":[]}
